    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="72">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 72</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{CXVI} Gif mon wergildðeof gefehð, ⁊ he losige ðy dæge þam monnum ðe hine gefoð, þeah hine mon gefo ymb niht, nah him mon mare æt ðonne fulwite.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a thief is caught who owes wergild for his offense, and he escapes on the day that he was caught from the men who caught him, but he is caught again before night, [the captors] need pay no more than the full fine.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If a thief, who has forfeited his wergeld is caught, and if he escapes the same day from his captors, yet is [re]captured before the night is passed, no more than the full fine shall be exacted from them.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif mon wergildþeof gefehð, ⁊ he losie þy dæge þam monnum þe hine gefoð, þeah hine mon gefó ymb nyht, nah him man mare æt ðonne fulwite.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
